### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Task",
  "description": "This is a test task",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8000/tasks/
Accept: application/json

### Get all tasks with status filter
GET http://localhost:8000/tasks?status=pending
Accept: application/json

### Get a task by ID (change {{task_id}} to real one after create)
GET http://localhost:8000/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Update a task (change {{task_id}} to real one)
PUT http://localhost:8000/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Test Task",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "status": "completed"
}

### Delete a task (change {{task_id}} to real one)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/tasks/1